  "id": "stimulus-bound",
  "term": "stimulus-bound",
  "definition": "Stimulus-bound describes a process that is driven automatically by the immediate input itself rather than by flexible, context-dependent control. In the source packet, absolute pitch is described this way because it treats heard notes as direct cues for fixed pitch labels.",
